{"version":1,"content":"<p>大家平日習慣機不離手，雙眼長時間近距離對着電子屏幕，難免感到乾澀痕癢。</p><p>如果想知道眼睛是否處於疲勞狀態，不妨試試日本介紹的10秒簡單驗眼法，只要透過兩種顏色便能快速評估眼睛健康。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;由日本電視節目《教え</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.674342+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"7bd0cdb1edf5cc86762e191604cdc91591e6a2f2b63360d274fbcf85cf1a4d24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}